{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01018",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.36,
      "end_seconds": 5.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Good evening, doctor, thanks for seeing me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 6.8,
      "end_seconds": 10.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.64,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.57,
      "end_seconds": 16.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 17.68,
      "end_seconds": 25.55,
      "duration_seconds": 7.87,
      "text": "Sorry, what was I saying, doctor, it's an irregular heartbeat. That's what we're worried about."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.86,
      "end_seconds": 30.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.77,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.99,
      "end_seconds": 37.05,
      "duration_seconds": 5.06,
      "text": "I take bisoprolol, 2.5 milligrams, maybe, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.41,
      "end_seconds": 43.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.25,
      "text": "So, do you have the packet or the prescription with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 45.06,
      "end_seconds": 47.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "No, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.3,
      "end_seconds": 56.89,
      "duration_seconds": 7.59,
      "text": "It's a... um, I can't remember what it's called. It's a small white one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.97,
      "end_seconds": 60.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Do you remember what it's for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.74,
      "end_seconds": 72.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.47,
      "text": "For my cholesterol, I believe. My son sets them out for me, I just take what I'm given."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 85.28,
      "end_seconds": 86.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.31,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 88.29,
      "end_seconds": 91.02,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Probably about two weeks. Yeah."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.35,
      "end_seconds": 95.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "How strong would you say it is?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.47,
      "end_seconds": 97.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.13,
      "text": "Moderate, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.21,
      "end_seconds": 105.54,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "And the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 105.64,
      "end_seconds": 111.0,
      "duration_seconds": 5.36,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.96,
      "end_seconds": 114.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.69,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.87,
      "end_seconds": 120.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "That's fine, one at a time. I'll ask about everything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 122.57,
      "end_seconds": 129.99,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "I've also had being short of breath on slopes, for about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.67,
      "end_seconds": 133.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.04,
      "end_seconds": 137.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "It just comes and goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 139.62,
      "end_seconds": 142.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "Have you had any chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.21,
      "end_seconds": 146.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "No chest pain, thankfully."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.6,
      "end_seconds": 150.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.63,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Any fainting, nosebleeds or black stools?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.03,
      "end_seconds": 163.2,
      "duration_seconds": 12.17,
      "text": "No, no fainting, no nosebleeds, no black stools. I did have occasional bruising at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.25,
      "end_seconds": 169.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "Right, any problems with your joints or muscles?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 170.48,
      "end_seconds": 172.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.91,
      "end_seconds": 177.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.35,
      "end_seconds": 181.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 183.16,
      "end_seconds": 185.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 187.32,
      "end_seconds": 194.26,
      "duration_seconds": 6.94,
      "text": "I have an irregular heartbeat, for five years. I've never really been one for hospitals."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.28,
      "end_seconds": 197.27,
      "duration_seconds": 0.99,
      "text": "Mm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.24,
      "end_seconds": 201.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "High cholesterol, for five years."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.69,
      "end_seconds": 205.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.6,
      "text": "Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 206.14,
      "end_seconds": 210.93,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Yes, I had part of my thyroid removed, years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.48,
      "end_seconds": 213.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.28,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.31,
      "end_seconds": 218.12,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.39,
      "end_seconds": 221.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.8,
      "text": "How are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.18,
      "end_seconds": 228.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.1,
      "end_seconds": 232.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 233.52,
      "end_seconds": 235.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.47,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 237.06,
      "end_seconds": 245.08,
      "duration_seconds": 8.02,
      "text": "So, hold on, doctor, I think she reacted to erythromycin once. I'm not certain, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.72,
      "end_seconds": 248.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Maybe, but I don't recall it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.34,
      "end_seconds": 258.17,
      "duration_seconds": 7.83,
      "text": "Alright, so that's unclear. I'll record what each of you said. Shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.72,
      "end_seconds": 271.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 291.96,
      "end_seconds": 295.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 119, blood pressure 120 over 83."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 296.28,
      "end_seconds": 297.9,
      "duration_seconds": 1.62,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.61,
      "end_seconds": 301.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Don't worry, we'll discuss it in a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 304.38,
      "end_seconds": 308.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.05,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 312.74,
      "end_seconds": 313.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Okay, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 315.71,
      "end_seconds": 318.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.61,
      "end_seconds": 340.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.18,
      "text": "Your pulse is irregular and your heart sounds are otherwise normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 344.76,
      "end_seconds": 347.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "Good, you can sit up again."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 365.48,
      "end_seconds": 394.81,
      "duration_seconds": 29.33,
      "text": "Putting it all together, it points towards atrial fibrillation, rate reasonably controlled. Another possibility is anaemia from bleeding. Let's get kidney function tests, for anticoagulant dosing. I'd like to arrange a full blood count for anticoagulant review. Never skip the blood thinner, and tell any dentist or surgeon you take it. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 397.76,
      "end_seconds": 410.01,
      "duration_seconds": 12.25,
      "text": "An ECG is something we might do if this doesn't improve in two weeks. Book a review in three months. Anything else on your mind before you go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 411.21,
      "end_seconds": 413.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor, goodbye."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 415.51,
      "end_seconds": 416.91,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
}